[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12484.03, "timestamp": "03:28:04", "text": "主。呃，我得想想办法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12487.51, "timestamp": "03:28:07", "text": "别的。呃，只有……等等，有多少？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12489.67, "timestamp": "03:28:09", "text": "等待。我只剩下几分钟时间了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12492.429, "timestamp": "03:28:12", "text": "需要总结一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12499.429, "timestamp": "03:28:19", "text": "呃，别演示，别演示该怎么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12504.349, "timestamp": "03:28:24", "text": "该怎么办？该怎么办？主意。主意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12509.51, "timestamp": "03:28:29", "text": "主意。我嗯。哦，你看到了吗？它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12512.67, "timestamp": "03:28:32", "text": "变得隐形了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12514.67, "timestamp": "03:28:34", "text": "如何？哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12517.19, "timestamp": "03:28:37", "text": "好的。主意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12520.07, "timestamp": "03:28:40", "text": "所以，我的想法是不做调音。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12523.11, "timestamp": "03:28:43", "text": "像这样分叉。不，我可以，我可以说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12524.79, "timestamp": "03:28:44", "text": "人们可能会想，“哦，等等。那是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12527.15, "timestamp": "03:28:47", "text": "音叉，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12529.59, "timestamp": "03:28:49", "text": "骑师？”它看起来像个音叉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12532.75, "timestamp": "03:28:52", "text": "嗯？它不是音叉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12535.07, "timestamp": "03:28:55", "text": "好的，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12538.95, "timestamp": "03:28:58", "text": "呃，等等，如果我做一个音叉呢？"}]